WEBVTT

00:08.690 --> 00:16.160
aozameta machinami yureru boku no kage

00:08.690 --> 00:16.160
The pale street, my swaying shadow,

00:16.160 --> 00:24.440
nibui ashidori wa yuku saki wo shirazu

00:16.160 --> 00:24.440
I walk slowly, not knowing my destination.

00:24.440 --> 00:30.480
kawasenu omoi

00:24.440 --> 00:30.480
My feelings can't reach yours.

00:31.240 --> 00:38.620
kimi no hitomi no naka utsushidasu mono wo

00:31.240 --> 00:38.620
The things reflected in the depths of your eyes,

00:38.620 --> 00:46.860
uketomeru tame ni hashiridashiteita

00:38.620 --> 00:46.860
I started running in order to catch up to them.

00:46.860 --> 01:00.640
sashidasu sono te wo hodokerai youni nigirikaesu

00:46.860 --> 01:00.640
I grip your outstretched hand without letting go.

01:01.170 --> 01:08.680
hanbun no tsuki no yoru wa bokura wo terashite

01:01.170 --> 01:08.680
On this night, the half moon shines upon us.

01:08.680 --> 01:15.990
oikaketekita jikan wo boku wa furikitte

01:08.680 --> 01:15.990
I shake off the flow of time chasing after us.

01:16.220 --> 01:27.430
hanbun zutsu no bokura wa egaku saki made mo mieru

01:16.220 --> 01:27.430
We're half of ourselves, but we can draw the future.

01:33.170 --> 01:38.180
School Life for Just One Day

01:40.550 --> 01:41.610
It hurts...

01:42.210 --> 01:43.610
How annoying...

01:47.850 --> 01:48.560
Ah...

01:51.920 --> 01:53.190
Ezaki...

01:53.190 --> 01:54.330
So...

01:54.330 --> 01:55.330
Err...

01:55.330 --> 01:56.530
What did I do?

01:57.030 --> 01:58.760
You don't remember?

01:59.330 --> 02:01.170
I have a slight recollection of it...

02:05.540 --> 02:06.700
Sorry...

02:19.320 --> 02:20.390
Umm...

02:20.390 --> 02:22.220
What was that about a specialist license test?

02:22.220 --> 02:23.030
Huh?

02:23.390 --> 02:24.420
To put it simply,

02:24.420 --> 02:27.430
it's a test you have to take to become a "specialist" doctor.

02:27.890 --> 02:29.530
How did you know about that?

02:31.400 --> 02:33.100
Could it be that I told you?

02:33.500 --> 02:35.770
You really don't remember?

02:35.770 --> 02:36.870
Hmm...

02:38.040 --> 02:39.110
I see...

02:43.440 --> 02:44.510
Ezaki,

02:44.510 --> 02:46.820
I was 17 once before too.

02:47.980 --> 02:50.320
Thinking about what happened back then now...

02:50.850 --> 02:52.750
It's really quite funny.

02:52.750 --> 02:54.450
Only thinking of myself...

02:54.690 --> 02:57.020
And trying to act cool, but my heart was empty.

02:58.290 --> 02:59.890
But I was happy,

02:59.890 --> 03:01.300
because it was a lot of fun.

03:01.690 --> 03:03.700
I never had to think of what would happen tomorrow...

03:03.700 --> 03:05.460
And I could start anew anytime I wanted.

03:06.230 --> 03:09.200
I never thought I'd lose anything too...

03:09.200 --> 03:10.540
I didn't understand anything...

03:11.070 --> 03:13.370
After all, I've never lost anything before.

03:14.410 --> 03:16.370
Honestly, it's unbearable.

03:17.110 --> 03:18.720
Why did it turn out like this?

03:20.910 --> 03:21.950
Ezaki.

03:21.950 --> 03:23.080
What is it?

03:23.850 --> 03:25.120
Get lost.

03:25.380 --> 03:26.120
Huh?

03:26.650 --> 03:27.750
Get lost!

03:36.660 --> 03:37.540
Ezaki?

03:38.630 --> 03:39.730
What is it?

03:40.300 --> 03:41.970
Cherish Rika!

03:42.700 --> 03:44.610
Cherish her as much as possible!

04:00.890 --> 04:01.690
Yuuichi.

04:03.690 --> 04:04.790
Hurray!

04:04.790 --> 04:06.130
It hit!

04:07.690 --> 04:09.790
It'd always been you who used this trick on me.

04:09.790 --> 04:11.500
I should have my revenge sometimes too.

04:11.500 --> 04:12.000
How was it?

04:12.000 --> 04:13.060
Was it good?

04:13.060 --> 04:15.310
I didn't think you would fall for it so easily.

04:15.770 --> 04:16.740
Rika?

04:19.970 --> 04:20.770
Idiot!

04:22.110 --> 04:23.010
It's my fault!

04:23.010 --> 04:24.080
I apologize!

04:25.380 --> 04:27.050
I said I apologize...

04:28.850 --> 04:31.160
Rika, please...

04:31.720 --> 04:33.690
Yuuichi! What happened to your face?

04:34.390 --> 04:35.890
It's full of bruises.

04:39.320 --> 04:40.890
Fighting with a group of bullies?

04:40.890 --> 04:42.160
How stupid...

04:42.160 --> 04:45.360
Because they were looking for trouble...

04:45.360 --> 04:48.200
There were five or six of them, so I didn't win...

04:48.200 --> 04:50.170
If it was one-on-one, I definitely would've won.

04:50.170 --> 04:50.800
Yeah!

04:50.800 --> 04:52.840
Why didn't you run away?

04:52.840 --> 04:54.470
How can I run away?!

04:54.470 --> 04:55.540
I'm a man, you know!

04:55.540 --> 04:56.740
What about being a man?

04:56.740 --> 04:58.540
What would you have done if you were seriously injured?

04:58.540 --> 04:59.710
Don't hit me...

04:59.710 --> 05:01.250
The bruises still hurt...

05:01.250 --> 05:03.080
That means you're still alive!

05:03.080 --> 05:04.380
This is your punishment! Punishment!

05:04.380 --> 05:06.020
I got it...

05:06.020 --> 05:06.720
Sorry...

05:06.720 --> 05:08.290
I apologized already...

05:08.290 --> 05:10.930
Okay, but you have to do something for me.

05:11.690 --> 05:12.560
Yuuichi...

05:13.390 --> 05:14.530
Let's go take some pictures!

05:15.190 --> 05:16.290
Take pictures?

05:19.700 --> 05:21.530
What nice weather.

05:22.630 --> 05:24.600
Where do you think you're going?

05:24.600 --> 05:25.270
Y-Yeah...

05:25.270 --> 05:26.540
Isn't it?

05:26.540 --> 05:27.640
What nice weather...

05:27.640 --> 05:29.770
I was thinking of walking around the yard for a bit...

05:29.770 --> 05:32.840
The kind of walk where you sneak out the back door?

05:32.840 --> 05:34.110
Then, let me accompany you.

05:34.750 --> 05:36.350
No, you don't have to...

05:36.350 --> 05:38.120
There must be something else you have to do.

05:38.120 --> 05:40.150
No, I finished everything. I'm on my way home.

05:42.050 --> 05:43.350
Alright, let's go!

05:43.350 --> 05:44.360
Let's walk.

05:44.920 --> 05:46.420
Let's walk!

05:46.420 --> 05:47.930
Please let me go!

05:47.930 --> 05:48.560
Huh?

05:49.030 --> 05:50.730
I want to make a trip back home!

05:50.730 --> 05:52.360
I'll be back in one hour!

05:52.360 --> 05:53.560
Why?

05:53.560 --> 05:55.070
I want to get the camera.

05:55.630 --> 05:56.600
Camera?

05:56.600 --> 05:57.300
Yeah.

06:00.410 --> 06:02.270
Forget about the walk, let's drive!

06:03.370 --> 06:04.810
Akiko-san, this...

06:04.810 --> 06:05.940
Isn't it nice?

06:05.940 --> 06:07.450
Racing seats...

06:07.450 --> 06:08.750
and 4-point crash webbing.

06:08.750 --> 06:10.760
How professional is that!

06:11.620 --> 06:13.820
I don't know how to buckle this...

06:14.750 --> 06:15.620
W-Wait...

06:15.620 --> 06:17.160
Well then, we're going!

06:24.530 --> 06:26.740
Your house is on Hukiage Street, right?

06:27.630 --> 06:28.770
Drive safely...

06:28.770 --> 06:30.340
I got it, I got it.

06:33.300 --> 06:34.970
Twin turbo!

06:34.970 --> 06:37.180
The definite partner for six-speed manual transmission!

06:37.180 --> 06:41.210
Wait until you're sure the lower gear speeds up to the next one before you change gear,

06:41.210 --> 06:42.910
so you won't slow down.

06:42.910 --> 06:45.860
Look closely and notice how I wait for a perfect chance to lower the gear!

06:46.280 --> 06:47.720
Umm...

06:47.720 --> 06:49.590
U-Umm...

06:50.460 --> 06:54.190
N-Natsume-sensei, when did he come to Wakaba Hospital?

06:54.190 --> 06:55.160
Huh?

06:55.160 --> 06:55.730
Umm, well...

06:55.730 --> 06:59.430
He wasn't in the hospital when I first checked in, right?

06:59.430 --> 07:00.330
Wha...?

07:00.330 --> 07:01.230
Yeah...

07:02.000 --> 07:04.200
About three months ago.

07:04.200 --> 07:07.710
It feels like he got a long break the moment he transferred here.

07:07.710 --> 07:08.610
He is...

07:08.610 --> 07:10.240
an irregular person.

07:10.580 --> 07:11.780
Irregular?

07:12.340 --> 07:15.780
Usually doctors like him won't come to our kind of country-side hospital.

07:15.780 --> 07:17.650
No matter what, he's got incredible skills,

07:18.050 --> 07:20.050
and is also very outstanding amongst the young doctors.

07:20.050 --> 07:23.520
I heard that in the surgical field, even some profs aren't as good as him.

07:24.420 --> 07:26.300
Sure is a strange guy.

07:28.190 --> 07:30.840
Honestly, that's why I said you're still a kid.

07:31.930 --> 07:34.100
He got demoted.

07:34.100 --> 07:36.630
It's strange enough that he got assigned to Shizuoka.

07:36.630 --> 07:39.670
Our hospital is much smaller.

07:40.140 --> 07:41.970
What happened?

07:41.970 --> 07:43.840
I don't know the details...

07:43.840 --> 07:46.320
But I heard he beat up a department head in school.

07:56.750 --> 07:59.760
Yuuichi, buckle up your seatbelt.

08:00.260 --> 08:03.760
Let me show you the real meaning of "High Speed Start".

08:11.740 --> 08:14.070
Ah! That was a nice race, eh?

08:14.070 --> 08:17.010
But he isn't good enough to be my opponent.

08:17.010 --> 08:19.380
I think my stomach is upset...

08:19.380 --> 08:21.180
Did you see that guy?

08:21.180 --> 08:22.910
He was so scared that he released the gas pedal.

08:22.910 --> 08:25.790
In the end, it's a test of fearlessness!

08:30.460 --> 08:32.090
What an old house.

08:32.090 --> 08:34.360
That chair will tilt if you don't sit right.

08:34.730 --> 08:35.930
How dangerous.

08:35.930 --> 08:36.730
Got it!

08:44.870 --> 08:46.100
Ah!

08:46.100 --> 08:47.910
What are you doing?

08:47.910 --> 08:50.480
Could this brat be Yuuichi?

08:50.480 --> 08:51.610
That's right...

08:51.610 --> 08:52.910
Stop looking at it!

08:52.910 --> 08:55.150
Look! Crying during a haircut!

08:55.150 --> 08:57.550
Your nose is running!

08:57.550 --> 08:59.250
Give it back to me!

08:59.250 --> 09:01.220
This is so cute, kid!

09:02.490 --> 09:04.720
Alright. Let's go, now that we have the camera.

09:05.360 --> 09:07.590
But why did you come back to get the camera?

09:08.030 --> 09:10.600
Rika said she wants to take some pictures.

09:10.860 --> 09:11.940
Rika?

09:18.940 --> 09:21.210
Sorry, I'm going to take a longer route.

09:21.210 --> 09:23.840
An old friend of mine returned to Ise.

09:24.140 --> 09:26.110
Where is that friend returning from?

09:26.110 --> 09:27.220
Tokyo.

09:32.820 --> 09:34.020
Thank you!

09:34.020 --> 09:35.450
Sorry about this, Akiko.

09:35.450 --> 09:37.620
Nah, it's on our way anyway...

09:37.620 --> 09:38.920
This is Yuuichi.

09:38.920 --> 09:41.200
He's a brat staying at the hospital right now.

09:41.830 --> 09:44.130
Nice to meet you, Yuuichi-kun.

09:44.130 --> 09:45.570
H-Hello.

09:46.960 --> 09:49.200
This is Yosano Misako.

09:49.200 --> 09:51.240
She's my friend from junior high school.

09:51.240 --> 09:53.580
Yuuichi-kun, how old are you?

09:54.240 --> 09:56.710
Seventeen. I'm in grade 12.

09:56.710 --> 09:58.180
Then you'll be taking the college entrance exam.

09:58.180 --> 09:59.640
How's your studying going?

09:59.640 --> 10:00.850
Umm...

10:00.850 --> 10:01.850
It's not...

10:01.850 --> 10:04.250
It's not good if you don't study hard.

10:04.250 --> 10:06.050
It'll be troublesome in the future.

10:07.350 --> 10:08.220
Ah...

10:08.220 --> 10:11.260
I guess it's not that convincing coming from me, huh?

10:12.060 --> 10:12.860
It sure isn't.

10:14.530 --> 10:15.590
Isn't it?

10:24.200 --> 10:25.270
What is it?

10:25.270 --> 10:27.440
N-No...

10:27.440 --> 10:28.970
It's nothing.

10:30.710 --> 10:32.740
How about you? What's so funny?

10:32.740 --> 10:34.380
It's nothing.

10:34.380 --> 10:36.210
Did something good happen?

10:36.210 --> 10:37.720
It's nothing.

10:43.990 --> 10:45.420
Is it here?

10:45.420 --> 10:46.960
Are you okay?

10:46.960 --> 10:49.160
This is my dad's camera.

10:49.160 --> 10:52.300
He always stored it really carefully and didn't let anyone touch it.

10:52.660 --> 10:55.270
So I'm not too sure how to use it.

10:56.300 --> 10:57.970
This should be okay...

10:58.440 --> 10:59.200
Alright!

10:59.200 --> 11:00.570
Strike a pose.

11:01.540 --> 11:02.340
I don't want to.

11:02.340 --> 11:03.710
Why is that?

11:04.280 --> 11:05.740
It's embarrassing...

11:05.740 --> 11:06.310
Eh?

11:06.310 --> 11:07.610
Did you take one just now?

11:07.610 --> 11:08.450
I did.

11:08.450 --> 11:09.210
Alright, show me a smile!

11:09.210 --> 11:10.150
I don't want to.

11:10.620 --> 11:12.780
Didn't you tell me to take some pictures of you?

11:15.290 --> 11:16.720
You took another one!

11:16.720 --> 11:17.720
I did.

11:17.720 --> 11:19.360
You're an idiot!

11:29.200 --> 11:30.370
What is it?

11:32.600 --> 11:33.300
Hmm?

11:33.300 --> 11:35.210
Are those people from your school?

11:35.210 --> 11:35.970
No.

11:36.910 --> 11:38.510
My school is over there.

11:43.510 --> 11:45.250
I really want to go take a look.

11:46.180 --> 11:47.720
School is...

11:47.720 --> 11:48.790
boring.

11:49.250 --> 11:52.120
I've never been to school before...

11:52.760 --> 11:54.660
I want to try out the uniform too.

12:03.940 --> 12:05.070
So cold.

12:05.070 --> 12:07.810
This is the one my sister used.

12:08.170 --> 12:09.510
Thank you, Miyuki.

12:12.610 --> 12:14.910
What do you need this for?

12:15.880 --> 12:18.350
There's a girl about my age in the hospital.

12:18.350 --> 12:20.250
She's always been living in the hospital,

12:20.250 --> 12:21.950
so she's never been to school before...

12:22.590 --> 12:25.560
She said she wanted to go to school a few days earlier...

12:26.160 --> 12:28.090
Once she's made up her mind, she won't listen to anyone...

12:28.090 --> 12:29.130
She's stubborn...

12:29.130 --> 12:30.830
And her personality is explosive...

12:31.330 --> 12:34.300
So, I thought I'd take her there for a bit...

12:34.870 --> 12:36.800
But she'll stand out if she doesn't wear a uniform...

12:38.270 --> 12:39.940
It's Rika-chan, right?

12:39.940 --> 12:40.710
Eh?

12:41.370 --> 12:42.910
How do you know?

12:44.080 --> 12:46.210
Yamanishi-kun is saying it everywhere...

12:46.610 --> 12:49.150
Yuu-chan found a girlfriend and is really happy,

12:49.150 --> 12:52.680
staying at the same hospital and being able to see each other as much as you want.

12:52.680 --> 12:54.920
Yamanishi, I'm going to kill you!

12:54.920 --> 12:56.290
She's a beauty, isn't she?

12:56.290 --> 12:58.260
I heard she's really cute.

12:58.260 --> 13:00.290
W-Well, I guess...

13:00.290 --> 13:03.090
No wonder Yuu-chan is working so hard.

13:03.090 --> 13:04.830
I'm not working hard.

13:06.260 --> 13:07.370
Oh well...

13:12.640 --> 13:14.340
Are you cold, Rika?

13:14.340 --> 13:17.210
Don't worry, the uniform is really warm.

13:17.640 --> 13:18.710
I see.

13:19.510 --> 13:20.850
On the other hand...

13:21.150 --> 13:22.980
Why did you guys come along as well?

13:22.980 --> 13:25.120
You can consider us as your backup.

13:25.120 --> 13:27.420
Yuu-chan is too stupid.

13:27.420 --> 13:29.520
He'll probably be discovered by a teacher.

13:29.520 --> 13:30.790
No, I'm not.

13:30.790 --> 13:33.290
We just want to help.

13:33.290 --> 13:34.130
You guys have no life.

13:35.090 --> 13:38.160
We're friends right, Ezaki?

13:38.160 --> 13:42.170
It'll be terrible if that demon councilor caught you.

13:42.670 --> 13:44.540
I'm sure you're here just to see that!

14:01.290 --> 14:02.790
Let's take a picture.

14:05.890 --> 14:06.690
Hey!

14:06.690 --> 14:07.930
Get out of the way, you guys...

14:07.930 --> 14:09.630
Why? It's fine like this.

14:09.630 --> 14:10.800
But...

14:10.800 --> 14:12.400
It's fine like this.

14:12.400 --> 14:13.460
It's fine!

14:13.460 --> 14:14.900
Yeah, it's fine!

14:16.230 --> 14:17.340
Then, I'm taking it.

14:23.240 --> 14:24.040
What is it?

14:24.440 --> 14:27.750
The air at school and the hospital are alike.

14:27.750 --> 14:28.810
Is it?

14:28.810 --> 14:29.710
Yeah.

14:29.710 --> 14:34.490
Ah, it has to be because the shoes in the shoe lockers smell like the slippers in the hospital.

14:34.490 --> 14:35.550
Ouch!

14:35.550 --> 14:36.750
What are you doing?

14:36.750 --> 14:37.760
Sorry.

14:37.760 --> 14:38.520
Ouch!

14:38.520 --> 14:39.920
You did that on purpose just now!

14:39.920 --> 14:41.030
Who knows...

14:41.030 --> 14:42.390
Hey! Over there!

14:42.760 --> 14:44.130
What are you guys doing?

14:44.130 --> 14:45.760
Damn, it's the demon councilor!

14:45.760 --> 14:46.830
Let's run!

14:46.830 --> 14:49.170
Hey! Wait up!

14:51.500 --> 14:52.270
Yuu-chan!

14:52.800 --> 14:53.740
You guys go first!

14:56.810 --> 14:58.240
Why are you running away?

14:59.280 --> 15:00.780
What are you guys hiding?

15:00.780 --> 15:02.110
Come with me to the counseling office!

15:02.110 --> 15:03.210
Wait!

15:06.250 --> 15:07.090
That's...

15:07.090 --> 15:08.520
Zebra Mask!

15:09.750 --> 15:12.160
I wonder if everyone is alright.

15:12.560 --> 15:15.030
Yuuichi's an idiot. He probably got caught.

15:15.030 --> 15:17.500
Do you want him to get caught?

15:18.530 --> 15:20.100
Will it be bad if he gets caught?

15:20.470 --> 15:21.600
Of course.

15:21.600 --> 15:22.900
Then let's go.

15:22.900 --> 15:23.800
Where?

15:23.800 --> 15:25.370
To where that teacher is.

15:25.370 --> 15:26.370
Eh?

15:26.370 --> 15:28.710
Yuuichi didn't do anything wrong.

15:28.710 --> 15:29.870
It was my fault.

15:29.870 --> 15:32.740
Wait, that's the demon councilor!

15:32.740 --> 15:36.350
But, if I don't go, he'll blame Yuuichi for this.

15:37.950 --> 15:39.220
So, let's go.

15:40.220 --> 15:41.090
Okay.

15:42.620 --> 15:44.390
You're Sekoguchi, right?

15:44.390 --> 15:46.060
I-I'm not.

15:46.990 --> 15:48.490
Then, who are you?

15:48.490 --> 15:50.030
I am Zebra Mask.

15:50.260 --> 15:51.830
Your voice sounds the same.

15:51.830 --> 15:53.600
That's not true...

15:54.230 --> 15:55.530
Don't lie to me!

15:55.530 --> 15:56.970
My voice is like this.

15:58.700 --> 15:59.570
Zebra!

16:06.110 --> 16:08.510
What kind of illness do you have?

16:09.780 --> 16:10.650
Will you die?

16:11.350 --> 16:12.080
Probably...

16:15.950 --> 16:16.920
Why?

16:16.920 --> 16:18.820
Heart defects...

16:18.820 --> 16:20.690
I will be having an operation soon...

16:20.690 --> 16:23.560
But the success rate isn't very high.

16:24.060 --> 16:24.930
I probably...

16:24.930 --> 16:26.000
can't go on anymore...

16:27.470 --> 16:28.600
Yuu-chan...

16:28.600 --> 16:30.100
Does he know?

16:31.440 --> 16:32.540
I wonder.

16:33.170 --> 16:34.570
He probably does.

16:36.710 --> 16:38.640
You two are childhood friends, right?

16:39.940 --> 16:43.210
What was Yuuichi like when he was small? Can you tell me?

16:44.820 --> 16:46.080
A normal kid...

16:46.480 --> 16:48.390
A bit weak...

16:48.390 --> 16:50.560
Liked to cry and liked to act tough...

16:50.560 --> 16:52.920
But if anything happened, he's the first to run.

16:55.860 --> 16:59.660
In junior high, he fought with his father very often.

16:59.660 --> 17:00.470
But...

17:00.470 --> 17:03.330
When he was young, he was really close to his dad.

17:04.000 --> 17:06.070
He used to always hang around his dad.

17:06.340 --> 17:08.070
I know about that!

17:08.540 --> 17:09.770
You know?

17:09.770 --> 17:10.610
Yeah.

17:12.010 --> 17:13.310
So you know...

17:13.910 --> 17:15.080
Wait...

17:15.850 --> 17:17.480
Can we go in?

17:40.000 --> 17:41.840
Is school life fun?

17:41.840 --> 17:43.170
Not at all...

17:43.170 --> 17:45.040
There's lots of rules, it's unbearable...

17:45.540 --> 17:46.640
How about the hospital?

17:46.640 --> 17:48.050
You just need to remember to wash your hands,

17:48.050 --> 17:51.450
and eat the medicine on time, that's all.

17:51.450 --> 17:52.880
How nice, the hospital...

17:52.880 --> 17:56.620
Miho

17:52.880 --> 17:56.620
Makoto

17:53.250 --> 17:55.150
The meals aren't very good.

17:55.520 --> 17:56.620
That's less desirable.

17:58.520 --> 17:59.290
Hey...

17:59.660 --> 18:01.260
Can I ask a personal question?

18:04.730 --> 18:06.630
Are you afraid to die?

18:09.300 --> 18:11.200
Before, I wasn't afraid to die...

18:11.640 --> 18:13.940
because I've always known that it would end up like that...

18:14.470 --> 18:15.310
And...

18:15.310 --> 18:16.940
When I was really uncomfortable...

18:16.940 --> 18:18.540
I would think it's better that way...

18:19.610 --> 18:20.550
But...

18:20.980 --> 18:22.750
I'm starting to become afraid...

18:24.880 --> 18:26.480
I'll think...

18:26.480 --> 18:27.650
"Will it be over just like this?"

18:30.820 --> 18:34.690
"Even if I were in the middle of that huge darkness, I won't be afraid."

18:35.460 --> 18:39.430
"I really am going to find out what will make people happy."

18:39.430 --> 18:43.270
"Let's go on together, on and on forever."

18:46.200 --> 18:48.270
Please don't tell this Yuuichi.

18:48.670 --> 18:49.910
Rika!

18:50.480 --> 18:51.240
Are you okay?

18:51.840 --> 18:52.940
Be quiet.

18:53.180 --> 18:54.280
But Rika...

18:54.280 --> 18:55.810
Honestly, you're too loud!

18:55.810 --> 18:57.050
But...

18:57.580 --> 18:59.680
Hey, where's the demon councilor?

18:59.680 --> 19:01.590
We don't have to worry about that anymore...

19:01.590 --> 19:02.220
Right?

19:06.190 --> 19:07.790
Sit over here!

19:07.790 --> 19:09.730
Sit and reflect upon your actions, got it?

19:09.730 --> 19:12.000
Causing us to look for you here again...

19:12.000 --> 19:15.200
You both disappeared at the same time. We thought you two ran off together!

19:15.200 --> 19:18.140
It caused a lot of commotion in the hospital.

19:18.140 --> 19:19.640
Running off together?

19:19.640 --> 19:22.570
Just because I treat you slightly better doesn't mean you can do whatever you want...

19:23.270 --> 19:25.610
Running off with Rika?

19:27.610 --> 19:29.810
Welcome home, Yuuichi.

19:30.320 --> 19:32.020
I-I'm back.

19:32.020 --> 19:33.790
Dinner is ready.

19:35.320 --> 19:36.650
How disgusting.

19:39.160 --> 19:41.230
What were you thinking about, smirking like that?

19:41.790 --> 19:43.060
What do you mean?

19:43.590 --> 19:46.330
Why is it that you can stand there and laugh at me?

19:46.330 --> 19:48.370
You committed the same crime.

19:48.370 --> 19:49.400
You should come and sit down as well.

19:49.400 --> 19:50.130
Okay.

20:01.150 --> 20:01.980
What is it?

20:01.980 --> 20:03.950
Didn't you want me to sit down?

20:04.380 --> 20:06.480
Oh, yeah, that is true...

20:06.480 --> 20:07.450
Oh right!

20:09.190 --> 20:11.420
You press this button, right?

20:11.420 --> 20:13.020
Yes, thank you very much.

20:13.730 --> 20:14.890
Ch-Ch...

20:14.890 --> 20:16.460
Cheese!

20:21.400 --> 20:22.470
Yuuichi,

20:22.870 --> 20:25.040
have you finished "Night on the Galactic Railroad"?

20:25.370 --> 20:26.240
I finished it.

20:26.940 --> 20:27.970
I see.

20:29.940 --> 20:31.010
Here.

20:31.010 --> 20:31.940
For you.

20:31.940 --> 20:32.740
Ouch...

20:32.980 --> 20:34.050
The next book.

20:34.050 --> 20:35.110
What is this?

20:35.110 --> 20:42.590
Les Thibault

20:35.950 --> 20:37.050
Umm...

20:37.050 --> 20:39.820
Du Gard's "Les Thibault".

20:39.820 --> 20:41.920
"Les Thibault"?

20:43.120 --> 20:45.220
It says it's the first volume.

20:45.220 --> 20:46.960
In total it's five volumes.

20:46.960 --> 20:48.590
There are five volumes?

20:48.590 --> 20:50.430
Are you serious?

20:50.430 --> 20:52.460
Just take your time to read them.

20:52.930 --> 20:54.800
Take my time, eh?

20:54.800 --> 20:57.140
But don't read it just yet.

20:57.140 --> 20:57.800
Huh?

20:58.600 --> 21:00.300
Before I tell you to,

21:00.300 --> 21:01.570
don't read it.

21:03.210 --> 21:04.840
Is this also your father's book?

21:05.510 --> 21:06.640
That's right.

21:16.420 --> 21:18.520
The weather is nice...

21:18.520 --> 21:19.590
Yuuichi.

21:23.390 --> 21:24.500
Yeah, it is.

21:28.630 --> 21:30.400
Spring is coming.

21:30.400 --> 21:32.370
Do you want to go look at the cherry trees?

21:33.440 --> 21:34.210
Yeah.

21:36.470 --> 21:38.080
It's time to go back.

21:38.080 --> 21:38.780
Okay.

21:42.310 --> 21:43.280
Yuuichi!

21:43.820 --> 21:44.980
Umm...

21:44.980 --> 21:45.750
What?

21:46.420 --> 21:47.490
Err...

21:47.950 --> 21:48.620
Huh?

21:51.760 --> 21:52.760
Next time...

22:03.300 --> 22:04.040
Huh?

22:17.220 --> 22:18.080
Rika?

22:19.780 --> 22:21.190
Are you alright, Rika?!

22:21.950 --> 22:22.790
What is it?!

22:22.790 --> 22:23.820
Rika!

22:24.220 --> 22:25.960
Rika!!

22:39.340 --> 22:48.810
nee, yubisaki de anata wo kanjite

22:39.340 --> 22:48.810
Hey, I felt you with my fingers.

22:51.420 --> 23:00.960
nee, anata to miteita kono keshiki

22:51.420 --> 23:00.960
Hey, while seeing this view together.

23:04.460 --> 23:14.270
tsutawaru yasashisa ni mi wo yudanete

23:04.460 --> 23:14.270
And then I committed myself to your kindness.

23:14.270 --> 23:25.620
eien nado nai wakatte ita tsumori dayo

23:14.270 --> 23:25.620
I know nothing lasts forever.

23:28.820 --> 23:34.790
namae wo yobu anata no koe wo

23:28.820 --> 23:40.770
I will keep your voice, which calls my name, in the bottom of my heart,

23:34.790 --> 23:40.770
mune no oku ni shimatte oku kara

23:40.770 --> 23:46.870
hirakareta tobira no mukou gawa de

23:40.770 --> 23:46.870
On the other side of the open door,

23:46.870 --> 23:54.080
koborenu youni kienai youni

23:46.870 --> 23:54.080
That it won't overflow, it won't disappear.

24:02.050 --> 24:06.790
Next Episode

24:03.890 --> 24:06.760
The sands of time are falling slowly...

24:07.130 --> 24:08.960
But as the amount of sand decreases...

24:08.960 --> 24:11.400
its speed accelerates...

24:12.100 --> 24:14.030
The time that Rika has...

24:14.030 --> 24:15.070
begins to accelerate.

24:16.000 --> 24:16.970
Sadness...

24:16.970 --> 24:18.100
Escape...

24:18.100 --> 24:19.640
But escape is impossible...

24:20.000 --> 24:22.210
Followed by unbearable pain...

24:22.940 --> 24:25.680
I realized my own inability.

24:26.940 --> 24:27.610
Next time:

24:27.610 --> 24:30.680
Looking up at the Half Moon: One Stopped Minute.

24:29.410 --> 24:32.080
One Stopped Minute
